        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Labyrinth Glitch</strong> is a cooperative horror experience for 1–4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silence has a sound — and it’s not what it should be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step feels wrong, every shadow seems to move when you’re not looking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only question is: how long can you keep going?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scary atmosphere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 to 4 player co-op!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Proximity voice chat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive AI </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game Difficulties </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stealth </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Large &amp; difficult map </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Primitive but challenging gameplay </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a typical Backrooms game. It doesn’t follow every detail from the online community. Instead, it offers a unique interpretation, integrating select elements in a fresh and atmospheric way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes flickering lights and audiovisual effects that may affect sensitive players. </p>",
